usage: writ expand <policy.json> [--out <file>]

Resolve extends, apply labels and rules, and print the layer-1 policy the kernel runs
as canonical JSON on one line, with each action's review, messages and source.
  --out <file>   write it to this file instead

Exit 0 when the policy expands, 1 when it or the policy it expands to has errors (printed
instead; warnings do not count), 2 when a file cannot be read, parsed or decoded.
